msgid "Synthetic Current Sensor/Analog Voltage Monitor"
msgstr "合成电流传感器/模拟电压监控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:8
#: a4bdd31949bc4bea88550c0b80f2fb8f
msgid ""
"Most autopilots have provisions for an external current sensor (normally as "
"part of an external power module or ESC) or an integrated current sensor. "
"For those using an external sensor, either using a power module or esc with "
"current sensor or telemetry is not desireable due to weight or other "
"considerations. In those cases, it may still be desired to obtain a measure "
"of the current for either consumption reporting or other uses. This battery "
"monitor backend provides a current estimate based on throttle position as "
"well as the normal analog voltage reporting."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控提供外部电流传感器接口（通常作为外部电源模块或 ESC "
"的一部分）或集成电流传感器。对于使用外部传感器的用户，若因重量或其他考虑不希望使用带电流传感器或数传的电源模块或 "
"ESC，仍可能需要获取电流测量值，用于电量消耗报告或其他用途。此电池监测后端基于油门位置提供电流估算，同时保留正常的模拟电压报告功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:10
#: 75746d3eb854414f8f117fb348c80f4b 9daadd6b024143dabde545d4c6f16a04
#: bfcc1a33e3f34f7eb5bf75d57fc7b921 ca9510c2e7c04c6ba5c36db4e6f67b41
#: d5e249f743614a14a1ab5a20aa82102e
msgid ""
"currently this estimate is accurate only for Plane, Blimp, and Rover primary"
" motors. Multicopter and QuadPlane VTOL mode current estimates are "
"inaccurate and not recommended for use. Future improvements to provide "
"accurate Multicopter and QuadPlane VTOL modes estimates are planned."
msgstr ""
"目前此估算仅对 Plane、Blimp 和 Rover 的主电机准确。多旋翼和 QuadPlane VTOL "
"模式的电流估算不准确，不建议使用。未来计划改进以提供准确的多旋翼和 QuadPlane VTOL 模式估算。"

