msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 25"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:18
#: 7ea771a169e44921bed297e134f16a07 919ec8aead824152b8483cfdadd9e56b
#: 9504815bf4434cc7b9722f8c6ecb1216 9b4333b1fd904cfd8aa5d495208d89d2
#: ce7d6f20c1e744a3ab4457a5a528b35d
msgid "For Voltage, the normal Analog Sensor parameters apply:"
msgstr "对于电压，适用普通模拟传感器参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:20
#: 0336bc50e0154961a61a1424509cbedc 10ede4720c85416fb1cfc5c5914d04fb
#: 78e9765a8dd649ecb6b5a8f9c4df5277 91400d821ce94e40ab78642efae5b90d
#: ca92c835bda9491791e9aed2ca73d5c6
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` The autopilot pin"
" connected to the power module's voltage pin"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 飞控上连接电源模块电压引脚的引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:21
#: 302eee8cc3794900a05b45c5d97acaf9 3e3b0e9f989c4877ac59afd36554655a
#: 8a38a6a9665d4282961832c02fc7d0f4 ae25c5d1ce304451af9f14c8ac5900a3
#: e7d6466576ac4fdaa3ffeb93a3e436ee
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` converts the "
"analog voltage received from the power module's voltage pin to the battery's"
" voltage. Provided on the :ref:`autopilot's hardware page:<common-"
"autopilots>` or manufacturers page."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"将从电源模块电压引脚接收的模拟电压转换为电池电压。可在 :ref:`飞控硬件页面 <common-autopilots>` 或厂商页面查找。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:23
#: 129f8cb0b4b449579a344efe94de1b92 ae80c114955340b4960d27074e815130
#: d3c89b5dfedb4fa5a3ddb55ea6bcba14 fe53c64759b54b6d90b8d651e2d387f9
#: fff01b79780e492588343e3cc850d022
msgid ""
"For the Current, some of the normal analog current sensor parameters have "
"been re-tasked to save flash and their names are therefore a bit misleading "
"in this application:"
msgstr "对于电流，部分普通模拟电流传感器参数被重新用途（为节省闪存），其名称在此应用中略有误导性："

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:25
#: 21bf6c14dc8e4bcba67755605d1be751 231f2d219ff54ba8b720e045759ce8bc
#: 3f10a3a75aeb4bcd9340eeead827824a 7ebdf915f06b48cb97ee79222a64db09
#: fdfefc442e7848c39ea136056c674256
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` is the "
"MAXIMUM current at full battery voltage in amps."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"为满电池电压时的最大电流（安培）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:26
#: 14a881af7e814d71b75bd8cbe1e23be2 4622a01f59d44016ac8a23ee87edb0db
#: 84daeca24040484d8711038dd69036fa 86e6af757c3e4055be45bc53512d2816
#: 9c2bc5cf4fa7487b8ba32c6ac37de2f5
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET <BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` is the idle "
"current (zero throttle) of the system in amps accounting for peripherals, "
"video,etc. Normally in the 0.3 to 0.5 range."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET <BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"为系统的怠速电流（零油门），单位安培，包含外设、视频等，通常在 0.3 至 0.5 范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:27
#: 10fc786412a74d05b43ef305b56dbb73 8821ef55b8614cb38be55917aa243632
#: dc0940d7c0dd4122b3a889c642980520 e7d4488752e543d489a9193b55f38264
#: f4219108e1ed43df84a63e1889ee8969
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MAX_VOLT<BATT_MAX_VOLT>` is the MAXIMUM fresh battery voltage. "
"Used to scale the estimate as the battery voltage decreases during use."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MAX_VOLT<BATT_MAX_VOLT>` 为新鲜电池的最大电压，用于随电池使用中电压降低而缩放估算值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:29
#: 1d0c3f790684497b980931781d3688d2 8b52616530234ae09cdc557edcf60fef
#: 920c9659a19843caa68ef0948a8cef27 92373a3515e24c7bb5dd0bbb90315f35
#: d03c0a0e3c4e4b0198d3d6cc0264ae5c
msgid ""
"Calibration of the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` value can "
"either be done on the bench with a current meter, or iteratively by "
"estimating an initial value, operating for while, measuring the amount of "
"current needed to restore the battery to full charge, and using that value "
"and a flight log's or OSD's total consumed mah for the flight to adjust the "
"parameter value:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"的校准可在台架上用电流计完成，也可通过迭代方式：先估算初始值，运行一段时间后测量将电池充满所需的电量，并用该值与飞行日志或 OSD 的总消耗 mAh "
"值来调整参数值："

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:31
#: 47131834a1b6446fb92f75d4889a8fb6 598f718af1d14af295cef223584d6d74
#: 91b310c084f8499ea6e6ce7a140069c5 e8f88adbf01d4e87afc74dd15603ef05
#: ff1b569815504c399822c5c0a84b03fa
msgid ""
"new value = old value * (mah returned to batt/log or OSD value of consumed "
"mah)"
msgstr "新值 = 旧值 × (返还至电池的 mAh / 日志或 OSD 的消耗 mAh 值)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:33
#: 05008a7245124dd2afa1f8f69f42fd2e 1863e3d3de2e45d8a0c0b5bafc664a3e
#: 1b70a3dc62294a2991e14d617374aed0 a21d975a12804d1f9e3dd6f1afc1cbda
#: f5c63f81535f45aeb64dc8b5903ab26c
msgid "one or two iterations of the above may be required."
msgstr "上述过程可能需要迭代一两次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-synthetic-current-monitor.rst:8
#: 0700bca7697a43938cc2ed2012ba7452 7c64307987fb4844bc236cacc99478d3
#: b8d2ba77929d48e0977aa9a68a31578a d414f901031f4c899ff5fdb6924d03e3
msgid ""
"Most autopilots have provisions for an external current sensor (normally as "
"part of an external power module or ESC) or an integrated current sensor. "
"For those using an external sensor, either using a power module or esc with "
"current sensor or telemetry is not desirable due to weight or other "
"considerations. In those cases, it may still be desired to obtain a measure "
"of the current for either consumption reporting or other uses. This battery "
"monitor backend provides a current estimate based on throttle position as "
"well as the normal analog voltage reporting."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控都支持外部电流传感器（通常作为外部电源模块或电调的一部分）或集成电流传感器。对于使用外部传感器的情况，有时出于重量或其他考虑，并不适合使用带电流传感器或数传的电源模块或电调。此时可能仍希望获得电流的估计值，用于电量消耗报告或其他用途。此电池监测后端基于油门位置提供电流估计，同时提供常规的模拟电压报告。"
